  "goodToKnow": "Die Verwerfung has several meanings: upheaval or disruption, mostly plural (wirtschaftliche, soziale Verwerfungen), a geological fault where rock layers have shifted (the Upper Rhine Graben is bordered by faults), and the rejection of an appeal or proposal. Verwerfen means to reject: einen Plan verwerfen, and verwerflich means reprehensible. Plural: die Verwerfungen."
